<h2>Aside 1.7.10</h2>

<p class="intro">Dictation got more comfortable: a better default key, a hands-free shortcut, and pasting that works in more apps.</p>

<h3>Dictation</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>The default key is now Left &#8963;.</b> If you never picked your own key, your dictation key changed from Right &#8984; to Left Control. Pick a different one any time under Settings &rsaquo; Dictation.</li>
  <li><b>Tap Space while holding to go hands-free.</b> Same effect as the double-tap: the mic stays open after you let go, until you confirm or cancel.</li>
  <li><b>Dictating into more apps just works.</b> Fields that Aside could not identify as text before &mdash; some web inputs and chat composers &mdash; now get the text pasted anyway, and it stays on the clipboard as a backup instead of asking you to copy it yourself.</li>
</ul>
